                    "description": "Jump into the adventure of a lifetime with the Songs from Tangled! Rapunzel, a princess with magical golden hair, has spent her whole life secluded in a tower with her evil Mother Gothel, until she crosses paths with a charming thief named Flynn Rider. Together, they embark on an epic journey across their kingdom as Rapunzel seeks to explore the world beyond her familiar tower walls and solve a mysterious phenomenon that may reveal the truth about her past.    \n\nThe soundtrack transports you to Rapunzel’s kingdom and immerses you in the adventure that Rapunzel and Flynn embark on, including the mishaps, the misfortunes and everything else in between.  The soundtrack features songs sung by Mandy Moore (the voice of Rapunzel), including the GRAMMY® Award nominated “I See The Light” and pop-hit “Something That I Want” performed by Grace Potter.   GRAMMY® is a registered trademark of the National Academy of Recording Arts and Sciences.",
